 "intro_zh": "哲罗姆派修道院位于在里斯本海港入口处，始建于1502年，它是葡萄牙艺术颠峰时期的最好例证。它旁边的贝莱姆塔，则是为纪念航海家瓦斯科·达·加玛的航行而建立的，它向人们讲述着那段奠定了现代世界基础的大航海时代。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "Standing at the entrance to Lisbon harbour, the Monastery of the Hieronymites – construction of which began in 1502 – exemplifies Portuguese art at its best. The nearby Tower of Belém, built to commemorate Vasco da Gama's expedition, is a reminder of the great maritime discoveries that laid the foundations of the modern world.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
